OL,3,GNEWSAViolence Reduction Unit reaches 1m
OL,4,ALondoners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of London's Violence
OL,7,FReduction Unit (VRU) has reached one
OL,8,Fmillion people in the capital, it has
OL,9,Fbeen announced.
OL,11,FThe unit, which was set up in 2019 by
OL,12,FLord Khan, has reached 750,000 young
OL,13,Fpeople and 250,000 parents, carers,
OL,14,Fyouth workers and professionals that
OL,15,Fwork with young people, to deliver a
OL,16,Fpublic health approach to youth crime
OL,17,Fin London.
OL,19,FThe number of young people admitted to
OL,20,Fhospital for knife assaults in London
OL,21,Ffell by 54% since 2019, the year the
OL,22,FVRU was created, according to NHS data.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
