OL,3,GNEWSAViolence Reduction Unit reaches 1m
OL,4,ALondoners
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhan said the unit, which focused on
OL,7,Fprevention, early intervention and
OL,8,Fdiversion, was founded on the principle
OL,9,Fthat "we cannot arrest our way out of
OL,10,Fviolence".
